  "configuration_id": "config_014",
  "reason": "The strongest result so far is config_036, a multimodal model using scvi RNA, ViT image features, avgpool, and concat fusion, with 0.715 validation accuracy and 0.687 F1. However, image-only ViT has not been tested, while image-only ResNet was weak, so it is unclear whether the gain comes from the ViT image representation alone or from fusing it with RNA. config_014 tests the image-only ViT setting with the same multiprofile and avgpool choices, providing the missing unimodal baseline. This is the best next experiment because it clarifies whether a simpler image-only model may already be competitive and whether multimodal fusion is actually adding value, which is more informative under a limited budget than immediately testing another fusion variant."
}

